        ],
        "title": "Differentiating the MSE",
        "text": "To find the derivative of the MSE with respect to $$\\theta_1$$, consider how the MSE changes as $$\\theta_1$$ changes. What happens to the expression for hat{y}_i when you take the derivative with respect to $$\\theta_1$$?",
